* Copyright (C) 2026 Gordon Heydon.  GPL-2.0-only (see LICENSE).
*
* MVPKG rebuild — rebuild the host's shared native (CallC) library from every
* installed contribution (recovery, or after a manual add/remove).  A no-op
* where the platform has no such library (e.g. MVX).
   SUBROUTINE MVPKG.REBUILD
   CALL MVPKGOS("REBUILD", "", "", ERR)
   IF ERR # "" THEN PRINT ERR ; RETURN
   PRINT "rebuilt the native library from installed contributions"
   RETURN
